    "notes": "D10. Five actual action drawings each facing: recover first dropped spear part, recover second, rejoin mechanical spear, inspect remaining bolts in existing LEFT launcher, listen alertly without salute. QA opened final B08 in both directions and approved the mechanical two-ended red-core spear held RIGHT and short launcher LEFT, with correct two-arm grips. Drawing A carries a source ellipse between the assembled weapon and later launcher already in hand: no continuous launcher draw or inventory transition is claimed. Final B calibration0 and unneeded intermediate1 excluded, with genuine check2/listen3 retained. Native spear detail/shaft angle varies between independently authored sheets; no exact prop scale, forest decor, sound, ammunition counter or campaign victory lifecycle certified. Fixed body references use MASK crown and Feral feet, excluding spear tips and ground parts. Right final B08 abdomen is noticeably redder than page A; this native color variation is recorded, not claimed as a coherent skin-color transition. Calibrations are excluded; playback durations are for visual inspection, not source mechanics."
